@host = http://localhost:5088

### Sign in as the admin. Copy accessToken from the response into @token below.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@restaurant.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

@token = paste-the-accessToken-here

### Today's public menu (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/api/menu?page=1&pageSize=12&onlyAvailable=true

### Today's specials only
GET {{host}}/api/menu/specials

### Restaurant context — including the authoritative service date
GET {{host}}/api/restaurant

### The daily menu plan for today (staff/admin)
GET {{host}}/api/daily-menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Schedule a dish onto a date, with a limited run and a promotional price
POST {{host}}/api/daily-menus?date=2026-08-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "menuItemId": 1, "quantityAvailable": 20, "specialPrice": 12.50, "note": "Chef's pick" }

### Price a cart server-side, before checkout
POST {{host}}/api/orders/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "Delivery", "items": [ { "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 2 } ] }

### The active kitchen queue, oldest first
GET {{host}}/api/orders?activeOnly=true&sortBy=oldest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Move an order along the lifecycle (invalid transitions are rejected)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Preparing" }

### Admin dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/overview?days=14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
